  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 mins. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65c463ea9d87f0bab617f9ab-0a4055a2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot and zucchini into rounds. Finely chop or crush garlic. Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook carrot and zucchini with a splash of water until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until tender, 1 min. Transfer to a bowl, season and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65c463ea9d87f0bab617f9ab-f2726c2b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Stir in katsu paste, the water, honey and butter, until bubbling, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65c463ea9d87f0bab617f9ab-ddc8e5e8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice and garlic veggies between bowls.\n• Top with katsu-glazed tofu. Spoon over any remaining sauce from pan. Sprinkle with crispy shallots.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65c463ea9d87f0bab617f9ab-8f428ae8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
